          </div>
          
          <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-[#FAF9F6] border-t border-[#D9DAD7] text-xs text-[#626A6F]">
            Direct administrator management &middot; Roles restrict access to yard calculations, feeding logs, and inventory tickets.
